{"parentUuid":"0acbf07f-525d-4b14-8d57-5604dad9c650","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d7fd903f-4eab-4718-8a3d-1c392317615c","agentId":"a96266f5aed302928","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01MDXh9pf73dHnix2hzZnLN7","type":"tool_result","content":"# symmetry_level Field Definition\n\nHere is the complete definition from the proto file:\n\n```\noptional int32 symmetry_level = 183 [default = 2];\n```\n\n**Comment:**\n\"Whether we try to automatically detect the symmetries in a model and exploit them. Currently, at level 1 we detect them in presolve and try to fix Booleans. At level 2, we also do some form of dynamic symmetry breaking during search. At level 3, we also detect symmetries for very large models, which can be slow. At level 4, we try to break as much symmetry as possible in presolve.\"\n\n**Level Breakdown:**\n\n- **Level 0:** Symmetry detection is disabled\n- **Level 1:** Detection occurs during presolve with Boolean variable fixing\n- **Level 2** (default): Includes Level 1 functionality plus dynamic symmetry breaking applied throughout the search process\n- **Level 3:** Extends to very large models but with increased computational cost\n- **Level 4:** Maximizes symmetry breaking efforts concentrated in the presolve phase"}]},"uuid":"f910de3b-ecb7-4572-a8af-ec8030dfe006","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:29:56.439Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"0acbf07f-525d-4b14-8d57-5604dad9c650","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"d706e79b-6646-4a48-9d82-9827c3b4224b","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d7fd903f-4eab-4718-8a3d-1c392317615c","agentId":"a96266f5aed302928","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","content":"Request failed with status code 303","is_error":true,"tool_use_id":"toolu_01K84LydtaeFfedZVo1bQaEJ"}]},"uuid":"cfe12daa-4319-461e-8aa3-af44013e33b5","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:29:57.285Z","toolUseResult":"Error: Request failed with status code 303","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d706e79b-6646-4a48-9d82-9827c3b4224b","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
{"parentUuid":"ca7f4e0a-0779-4a1e-81c7-d41a13c61551","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d7fd903f-4eab-4718-8a3d-1c392317615c","agentId":"a96266f5aed302928","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_011gcDrU7UjqXByrU9LjxALP","type":"tool_result","content":"# Summary of symmetry_level=3 Discussion\n\n## Timeout Limits\nThe issue describes that when `symmetry_level` is set to 3 (forcing symmetry finding on large problems), the solver implements a hard-coded 1-second deterministic time limit for symmetry detection. If this limit is exceeded, an error occurs during initial refinement, preventing symmetry benefits from being realized on larger models.\n\n## Key Points About symmetry_level=3\n\nAccording to the issue reporter:\n- Setting `symmetry_level:3` forces symmetry finding to activate\n- Unlike lower levels, level 3 applies even to large problems\n- However, the fixed time constraint undermines its effectiveness for sufficiently complex models\n\n## Potential Workarounds\n\nThe issue suggests three alternatives (none ideal):\n\n1. **Increase the hard-coded timeout** — The reporter tested this locally and observed substantial solve time improvements, but questioned whether the original limit had important justification\n\n2. **Disable the time limit conditionally** — Remove timeout constraints specifically when `symmetry_level > 2`, though feasibility was uncertain\n\n3. **Accept the limitation** — Allow large problems to remain unable to benefit from forced symmetry finding\n\nThe core request is to expose this timeout as a configurable parameter rather than hard-coded."}]},"uuid":"cc512ae8-ea75-46f2-9602-a4d25b7adb0b","timestamp":"2026-05-07T20:30:00.098Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"ca7f4e0a-0779-4a1e-81c7-d41a13c61551","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"D:\\claude pj\\zmd","sessionId":"7db7f276-a2bf-4762-b9b8-bb35f8cf3fb9","version":"2.1.128","gitBranch":"master","slug":"squishy-zooming-sphinx"}
